<GdsHeading Level="1">Inset Text</GdsHeading>

<p class="govuk-body">
    Use the inset text component to differentiate a block of text from the content that surrounds it.
</p>

<GdsHeading Level="2">Example</GdsHeading>

<p class="govuk-body">
    It can take up to 8 weeks to register a lasting power of attorney if there are no mistakes in the application.
</p>

<GdsInsetText Text="You'll need to include documents and may need to provide more information before the Office of the Public Guardian can register your lasting power of attorney." />

<p class="govuk-body">
    You can contact the Office of the Public Guardian if you have questions about your application.
</p>

